## Repository-root .dockerignore
## Build context for web/Dockerfile and worker/Dockerfile is this directory (java/),
## required because the Maven build is a multi-module reactor (root pom.xml + web + worker).

**/target/
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.idea
**/*.iml
**/.vscode

.git
.github
.azure
logs/
pids/
storage/
uploads/
infra/
doc-media/

*.md
!README.md

.env
.env.*
